    "type": "amended",
    "actor": "Parliament (Retained EU Law (Revocation and Reform) Act 2023)",
    "note": "\"Retained EU law\" is renamed \"assimilated law\"; EU-derived supremacy and general principles are abolished from the end of 2023."
